         <dc:displaytitle>Nomex¬Æ Type 410 - Properties </dc:displaytitle>
         <dc:shortdesc>DuPont‚Ñ¢ Nomex¬Æ paper Type 410 is an insulation paper which offers high inherent dielectric strength, mechanical toughness,&#xA;flexibility and resilience. Nomex¬Æ paper Type 410 is the original form of Nomex¬Æ paper, and is widely used in a majority of&#xA;electrical equipment applications. </dc:shortdesc>
